    "preamble": "Kaluva Bhaskar Al vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh., on 21 September, 2020 Author: M.Satyanarayana Murthy Bench: M.Satyanarayana Murthy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice M.Satyanarayana Murthy Criminal Petition No.3938 Of 2020 Order:",
